structor","text":"Constructor","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"index","text":"index","level":5},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"accessors","text":"Accessors","level":2},{"id":"keycount","text":"keyCount","level":3},{"id":"get-signature","text":"Get Signature","level":4},{"id":"returns-2","text":"Returns","level":5},{"id":"implementation-of","text":"Implementation of","level":4},{"id":"supportsrangeoptimization","text":"supportsRangeOptimization","level":3},{"id":"get-signature-2","text":"Get Signature","level":4},{"id":"returns-3","text":"Returns","level":5},{"id":"implementation-of-2","text":"Implementation of","level":4},{"id":"methods","text":"Methods","level":2},{"id":"canoptimizerangefor","text":"canOptimizeRangeFor()","level":3},{"id":"parameters-2","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"value","text":"value","level":5},{"id":"returns-4","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"implementation-of-3","text":"Implementation of","level":4},{"id":"lookup","text":"lookup()","level":3},{"id":"parameters-3","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"operation","text":"operation","level":5},{"id":"value-2","text":"value","level":5},{"id":"returns-5","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"implementation-of-4","text":"Implementation of","level":4},{"id":"rangequery","text":"rangeQuery()","level":3},{"id":"parameters-4","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"options","text":"options","level":5},{"id":"returns-6","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"implementation-of-5","text":"Implementation of","level":4},{"id":"supports","text":"supports()","level":3},{"id":"parameters-5","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"operation-2","text":"operation","level":5},{"id":"returns-7","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"implementation-of-6","text":"Implementation of","level":4},{"id":"take","text":"take()","level":3},{"id":"parameters-6","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"n","text":"n","level":5},{"id":"from","text":"from","level":5},{"id":"filterfn","text":"filterFn?","level":5},{"id":"returns-8","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"implementation-of-7","text":"Implementation of","level":4},{"id":"takefromstart","text":"takeFromStart()","level":3},{"id":"parameters-7","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"n-2","text":"n","level":5},{"id":"filterfn-2","text":"filterFn?","level":5},{"id":"returns-9","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"implementation-of-8","text":"Implementation of","level":4}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/indexes/reverse-index.ts:4](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/indexes/reverse-index.ts#L4)\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TKey\n\n`TKey` *extends* `string` \\| `number`\n\n## Implements\n\n- [`IndexReader`](../type-aliases/IndexReader.md)\\<`TKey`\\>\n\n## Constructors\n\n### Constructor\n\n```ts\nnew ReverseIndex<TKey>(index): ReverseIndex<TKey>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/indexes/reverse-index.ts:9](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/indexes/reverse-index.ts#L9)\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### index\n\n[`IndexInterface`](../interfaces/IndexInterface.md)\\<`TKey`\\>\n\n#### Returns\n\n`ReverseIndex`\\<`TKey`\\>\n\n## Accessors\n\n### keyCount\n\n#### Get Signature\n\n```ts\nget keyCount(): number;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/indexes/reverse-index.ts:55](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/indexes/reverse-index.ts#L55)\n\n##### Returns\n\n`number`\n\n#### Implementation of\n\n```ts\nIndexReader.keyCount\n```\n\n***\n\n### supportsRangeOptimization\n\n#### Get Signature\n\n```ts\nget supportsRangeOptimization(): boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/indexes/reverse-index.ts:47](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/indexes/reverse-index.ts#L47)\n\nWhether range lookups (gt/gte/lt/lte) on this index can be trusted to\nreturn every matching key. Range traversal relies on the index ordering, so\nit is unsafe when the index uses a custom comparator, whose order may not\nmatch the WHERE evaluator's relational operators. Callers must fall back to\na full scan when this is `false`.\n\n##### Returns\n\n`boolean`\n\n#### Implementation of\n\n```ts\nIndexReader.supportsRangeOptimization\n```\n\n## Methods\n\n### canOptimizeRangeFor()\n\n```ts\ncanOptimizeRangeFor(value): boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/indexes/reverse-index.ts:51](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/indexes/reverse-index.ts#L51)\n\nWhether the live values in this index share the predicate operand's\nrelational domain. Mixed domains can sort differently in the index and\nWHERE evaluator, which can make a range lookup omit matching rows.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### value\n\n`unknown`\n\n#### Returns\n\n`boolean`\n\n#### Implementation of\n\n```ts\nIndexReader.canOptimizeRangeFor\n```\n\n***\n\n### lookup()\n\n```ts\nlookup(operation, value): Set<TKey>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/indexes/reverse-index.ts:15](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/indexes/reverse-index.ts#L15)\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### operation\n\n`\"eq\"` | `\"gt\"` | `\"gte\"` | `\"lt\"` | `\"lte\"` | `\"in\"` | `\"like\"` | `\"ilike\"`\n\n##### value\n\n`any`\n\n#### Returns\n\n`Set`\\<`TKey`\\>\n\n#### Implementation of\n\n```ts\nIndexReader.lookup\n```\n\n***\n\n### rangeQuery()\n\n```ts\nrangeQuery(options): Set<TKey>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/indexes/reverse-index.ts:29](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/indexes/reverse-index.ts#L29)\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### options\n\n[`BTreeRangeQueryOptions`](../interfaces/BTreeRangeQueryOptions.md) = `{}`\n\n#### Returns\n\n`Set`\\<`TKey`\\>\n\n#### Implementation of\n\n```ts\nIndexReader.rangeQuery\n```\n\n***\n\n### supports()\n\n```ts\nsupports(operation): boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/indexes/reverse-index.ts:43](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/indexes/reverse-index.ts#L43)\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### operation\n\n`\"eq\"` | `\"gt\"` | `\"gte\"` | `\"lt\"` | `\"lte\"` | `\"in\"` | `\"like\"` | `\"ilike\"`\n\n#### Returns\n\n`boolean`\n\n#### Implementation of\n\n```ts\nIndexReader.supports\n```\n\n***\n\n### take()\n\n```ts\ntake(\n   n, \n   from, \n   filterFn?): TKey[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/indexes/reverse-index.ts:33](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/indexes/reverse-index.ts#L33)\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### n\n\n`number`\n\n##### from\n\n`any`\n\n##### filterFn?\n\n(`key`) => `boolean`\n\n#### Returns\n\n`TKey`[]\n\n#### Implementation of\n\n```ts\nIndexReader.take\n```\n\n***\n\n### takeFromStart()\n\n```ts\ntakeFromStart(n, filterFn?): TKey[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/indexes/reverse-index.ts:37](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/indexes/reverse-index.ts#L37)\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### n\n\n`number`\n\n##### filterFn?\n\n(`key`) => `boolean`\n\n#### Returns\n\n`TKey`[]\n\n#### Implementation of\n\n```ts\nIndexReader.takeFromStart\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: ReverseIndex\ntitle: ReverseIndex\n---\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/indexes/reverse-index.ts:4](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/indexes/reverse-index.ts#L4)\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TKey\n\n`TKey` *extends* `string` \\| `number`\n\n## Implements\n\n- [`IndexReader`](../type-aliases/IndexReader.md)\\<`TKey`\\>\n\n## Constructors\n\n### Constructor\n\n```ts\nnew ReverseIndex<TKey>(index): ReverseIndex<TKey>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/indexes/reverse-index.ts:9](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/indexes/reverse-index.ts#L9)\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### index\n\n[`IndexInterface`](../interfaces/IndexInterface.md)\\<`TKey`\\>\n\n#### Returns\n\n`ReverseIndex`\\<`TKey`\\>\n\n## Accessors\n\n### keyCount\n\n#### Get Signature\n\n```ts\nget keyCount(): number;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/indexes/reverse-index.ts:55](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/indexes/reverse-index.ts#L55)\n\n##### Returns\n\n`number`\n\n#### Implementation of\n\n```ts\nIndexReader.keyCount\n```\n\n***\n\n### supportsRangeOptimization\n\n#### Get Signature\n\n```ts\nget supportsRangeOptimization(): boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/indexes/reverse-index.ts:47](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/indexes/reverse-index.ts#L47)\n\nWhether range lookups (gt/gte/lt/lte) on this index can be trusted to\nreturn every matching key. Range traversal relies on the index ordering, so\nit is unsafe when the index uses a custom comparator, whose order may not\nmatch the WHERE evaluator's relational operators. Callers must fall back to\na full scan when this is `false`.\n\n##### Returns\n\n`boolean`\n\n#### Implementation of\n\n```ts\nIndexReader.supportsRangeOptimization\n```\n\n## Methods\n\n### canOptimizeRangeFor()\n\n```ts\ncanOptimizeRangeFor(value): boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/indexes/reverse-index.ts:51](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/indexes/reverse-index.ts#L51)\n\nWhether the live values in this index share the predicate operand's\nrelational domain. Mixed domains can sort differently in the index and\nWHERE evaluator, which can make a range lookup omit matching rows.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### value\n\n`unknown`\n\n#### Returns\n\n`boolean`\n\n#### Implementation of\n\n```ts\nIndexReader.canOptimizeRangeFor\n```\n\n***\n\n### lookup()\n\n```ts\nlookup(operation, value): Set<TKey>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/indexes/reverse-index.ts:15](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/indexes/reverse-index.ts#L15)\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### operation\n\n`\"eq\"` | `\"gt\"` | `\"gte\"` | `\"lt\"` | `\"lte\"` | `\"in\"` | `\"like\"` | `\"ilike\"`\n\n##### value\n\n`any`\n\n#### Returns\n\n`Set`\\<`TKey`\\>\n\n#### Implementation of\n\n```ts\nIndexReader.lookup\n```\n\n***\n\n### rangeQuery()\n\n```ts\nrangeQuery(options): Set<TKey>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/indexes/reverse-index.ts:29](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/indexes/reverse-index.ts#L29)\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### options\n\n[`BTreeRangeQueryOptions`](../interfaces/BTreeRangeQueryOptions.md) = `{}`\n\n#### Returns\n\n`Set`\\<`TKey`\\>\n\n#### Implementation of\n\n```ts\nIndexReader.rangeQuery\n```\n\n***\n\n### supports()\n\n```ts\nsupports(operation): boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/indexes/reverse-index.ts:43](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/indexes/reverse-index.ts#L43)\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### operation\n\n`\"eq\"` | `\"gt\"` | `\"gte\"` | `\"lt\"` | `\"lte\"` | `\"in\"` | `\"like\"` | `\"ilike\"`\n\n#### Returns\n\n`boolean`\n\n#### Implementation of\n\n```ts\nIndexReader.supports\n```\n\n***\n\n### take()\n\n```ts\ntake(\n   n, \n   from, \n   filterFn?): TKey[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/indexes/reverse-index.ts:33](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/indexes/reverse-index.ts#L33)\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### n\n\n`number`\n\n##### from\n\n`any`\n\n##### filterFn?\n\n(`key`) => `boolean`\n\n#### Returns\n\n`TKey`[]\n\n#### Implementation of\n\n```ts\nIndexReader.take\n```\n\n***\n\n### takeFromStart()\n\n```ts\ntakeFromStart(n, filterFn?): TKey[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/indexes/reverse-index.ts:37](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/indexes/reverse-index.ts#L37)\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### n\n\n`number`\n\n##### filterFn?\n\n(`key`) => `boolean`\n\n#### Returns\n\n`TKey`[]\n\n#### Implementation of\n\n```ts\nIndexReader.takeFromStart\n```\n"}
